::GEO_U02_L06_GP_Q01::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L06_GP_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.TRI.1<br><br>Question:<br>Two triangles have three pairs of corresponding sides congruent. Which criterion proves congruence? {
